%% UC-07 — Request personalised recommendations (RAG pipeline)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (recommendRouter)
    participant AI as API-service (FastAPI)
    participant R as Redis
    participant LR as LightRAG
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Enter health goal
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/recommend {goal}
    B->>AI: POST /llm/recommend {user_id, goal, session_id} (service token)
    AI->>R: GET cache(hash(user_id, goal))
    alt cache hit
        R-->>AI: cached recommendations
    else cache miss
        par extract habits
            AI->>LLM: extract-habits (user's donated habits)
        and extract profile
            AI->>LLM: extract-profile (questionnaire answers)
        end
        LLM-->>AI: habits summary + profile + rag_query
        AI->>LR: POST /query {query: rag_query, mode: "hybrid", only_need_context: true}
        LR-->>AI: synthesized KB context (graph + vector)
        AI->>LLM: recommend prompt (goal + profile + habits + context)
        LLM-->>AI: recommendations JSON
        AI->>R: SETEX cache (TTL 24h)
        AI->>M: insert(recommendations)
    end
    AI-->>B: {recommendations: [...]}
    B-->>F: 200 recommendations
    F->>F: Render recommendation cards
